 "description": "Fetch a published diagram's current Mermaid source by name or slug, and show it rendered. The returned source is stamped with the diagram's identity \u2014 keep the `line9:` frontmatter block when you edit it so that Line9 recognises the diagram when it is opened and published there instead of creating a new one. Requires Line9 sign-in. This connector cannot publish or save. To publish, the user opens the diagram in Line9 (the `open_url` link) and publishes there \u2014 not with the Line9 CLI.",
